[00:00.00] 作曲 : Ella Langley/Joybeth Taylor/Meg McRee/Chris LaCorte
[00:00.00][by:波罗猫与海鸥心]
[00:08.89]I used to want this so bad, I swore I could taste it
[00:08.89]我曾无比渴望这一切 仿佛触手可及
[00:14.51]Did anything and everything it took
[00:14.51]为此不顾一切 倾尽所有
[00:17.11]Took a lot to get where I'm at, so I ain't gonna waste it
[00:17.11]走到如今实属不易 我绝不会虚度分毫
[00:22.74]And damn if it don't feel good
[00:22.74]这种感觉真的无比美好
[00:25.70]
[00:25.89]But I miss my mama and that small town drama
[00:25.89]可我想念妈妈 想念小镇的烟火喧嚣
[00:30.34]Got what I wanted, but what If I still wanna
[00:30.34]我得到了梦寐以求的一切 却仍心有不甘
[00:34.16]
[00:34.46]House on a hill, a horse in the yard
[00:34.46]山间小屋 庭院骏马
[00:38.52]A dog at my feet, just a-pickin' my guitar
[00:38.52]脚边卧着小狗 我轻弹吉他
[00:42.60]The sun going down, supper's on the stove
[00:42.60]夕阳西下 炉上温着晚餐
[00:46.62]A hard workin' man taking oﬀ his dirty work clothes
[00:46.62]辛劳的男人褪去满是尘土的衣衫
[00:51.26]While I'm living the dream, all I'm dreaming about
[00:51.26]我活在梦想之中 心心念念的
[00:55.47]Is slowing down just a little
[00:55.47]只是想放慢脚步
[00:59.60]When I lay there and close my eyes
[00:59.60]当我躺下闭上双眼
